  "title": "Reserve Airmen saves lives as part of Hurricane Harvey relief effort",
  "description": "Pararescuemen of the 920th Rescue Wing deliver Hurricane Harvey victims to a safe haven collection point after rescuing them in an HH-60 Pave Hawk helicopter Aug. 31, 2017 near Beaumont, Texas. The 920th RQW deployed roughly 90 people, three HH-60 Pave Hawks and two HC-130Ns to College Station, Texas to support Air Force North's search and rescue mission for FEMA disaster relief. (U.S. Air Force video/Tech. Sgt. Lindsey Maurice)",
